MELIORATION.LIST:
• monitoring the level and mineralisation of groundwater;
• surveying irrigated land and determining soil salinity;
• monitoring runoff and the condition of collector-drainage water;
• sampling and laboratory analysis of water and soil;
• analysis and mapping of the data obtained.

DIGITALIZATION.SEC3_LIST:
• equipping observation points with automatic measuring instruments;
• real-time data transmission: levels, flow rates, temperature, chemical composition;
• remote metering of water abstraction.

DIGITALIZATION.SEC4_LIST:
• a unified spatial database;
• 3D modelling of aquifers;
• creating digital twins of strategic artesian basins;
• a national groundwater geoportal.

DIGITALIZATION.SEC5_LIST:
• automatic data quality checks;
• detecting anomalies and risks of depletion and contamination;
• forecasting the state of groundwater;
• optimising the operation of deposits.

DIGITALIZATION.SEC7_LIST:
• digital well documentation;
• automated control of drilling operations;
• use of remote sensing and digital mapping databases.
